untame (peaceful) after I left the level for too long, and it always
jumped around my feet, but refused to follow me upstairs; I intended
to park him in a branch since he was already level 37 and 280 HPs
(or so) and I didn't had the wish to fight him once he got completely
feral. The arch-lich was adjacent and not scared, so I wondered why
he did not leave the level. If they're _tame_ or _hostile_ they *do*
follow you, usually. Not so this peaceful buddy. (While I seem to
recall that altar-summoned peaceful demons will follow you across
levels.)

